phrase: restrict suffix comparison values under {ceiling}
slot: ceiling int
test: list=10,20,50,40 ceiling=30
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="suffix while clamped 2" errors=0 n=4 res=[10,20,30,30] cache=0 hits=0
test: list=5,15,35,25 ceiling=20
