phrase: recursively compute fault sequence weight up to {depth}
slot: depth int
test: list=1,2,3,4 depth=3
expect: => i=6 r=0.0 ok=true s="" errors=0 n=4 res=[1,2,3,4] cache=0 hits=0
test: list=10,20 depth=2
